// At 2,000 concurrent users: 5,150 req/s, p95 latency 2,400ms -
//   CONFIRMED: throughput has genuinely PLATEAUED around ~5,100
//   req/s regardless of additional load - this IS the system's
//   actual bottleneck-determined maximum throughput

// Identifying WHICH specific resource is the actual bottleneck
// (checking each candidate directly, rather than guessing):
// - CPU utilization during the plateau: 35% - NOT the bottleneck
// - Database connection pool: 100/100 connections in use - FOUND IT
//   - this specific resource is exhausted exactly when throughput
//     plateaus, identifying it as the genuine, confirmed bottleneck

